{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16641","headline":"经湛长史草堂 · 吕渭","name":"经湛长史草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩居旧风景，人世今成昔。\n木落古山空，猨啼秋月白。\n谁同西府僚，几谢南平客。\n摧残松桂老，萧散烟云夕。\n迹留异代远，境入空门寂。\n惟有草堂僧，陈诗在石壁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}